[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012100_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012100_03_0010","text":"────有没有留下什么遗憾？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012100_03_0020","text":"没有"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012100_03_0030","text":"是吗……\n那，有什么收获吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012100_03_0040","text":"谁知道呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012100_03_0050","text":"比如感受到了自己的成长之类的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012100_03_0060","text":"那种东西自己说了也没意义吧\n不是该由别人来评价的吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012100_03_0070","text":"原来如此……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012100_03_0080","text":"那……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012100_03_0090","text":"合宿，开心吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012100_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012100_03_0100","text":"……是啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012100_03_0110","text":"您倒是看起来很开心呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012100_03_0120","text":"诶"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012100_03_0130","text":"您又不用上练习课，\n想必好好享受了一番度假时光吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012100_03_0140","text":"诶，不不不"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012100_03_0150","text":"与风嬉戏\n与大地亲近"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012100_03_0160","text":"误会，都是误会\n工作也好好────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012100_03_0170","text":"“也”？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012100_03_0171","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012100_03_0180","text":"……──────"}]
